# AlarmApp Watch

- **Watch = quick decisions; iPhone = planning** (`docs/01`).
- **Offline-first wake:** On “Uyandım”, cancel Watch-local notifications first, then sync via WatchConnectivity (`docs/02` §3).
- **Uyandım control:** ≥ 44×44 pt, high contrast, haptic feedback.
- **Undo:** 10 seconds on W2; leaving the app without undo commits the cancel.
- **Cache only `TodayContext`** (and related summaries) — not full group/exception history (`docs/03` §2).
- Complications (W3): follow HIG Complications; see `docs/09-referans-kaynaklar.md`.
